## Bank — deposit accounts

- [Savings Account](https://www.ally.com/bank/online-savings-account/): no monthly maintenance fee, no minimum opening deposit. Buckets and boosters for goal-based saving. Canonical page for the Savings APY and its effective date.
- [Spending Account](https://www.ally.com/bank/interest-checking-account/): interest-bearing checking. No monthly maintenance fee, no overdraft fees, Allpoint ATM network.
- [Money Market Account](https://www.ally.com/bank/money-market-account/): debit card and check access with savings-tier APY.
- [High Yield CD](https://www.ally.com/bank/high-yield-cd/): fixed-term CD, terms from 3 months to 5 years.
- [No Penalty CD](https://www.ally.com/bank/no-penalty-cd/): 11-month term, withdraw the full balance plus interest after 6 days with no penalty.
- [Raise Your Rate CD](https://www.ally.com/bank/raise-your-rate-cd/): 2- and 4-year terms with the option to increase the rate if Ally's rate rises.
- [CD Ladder](https://www.ally.com/bank/cd-ladder/): how to build a CD ladder with Ally terms.
- [IRA accounts](https://www.ally.com/bank/ira/): IRA Savings and IRA CDs, Traditional and Roth.
- [Trust Account](https://www.ally.com/bank/trust-account/): deposit accounts held in trust.

